SDK side of taller-than-16:9 display support: the native guest output
grows in height (width kept) when the target aspect is taller than the
frontbuffer, the guest keeps its 16:9 video mode for any non-16:9 target,
and the settings menu calls the option "Match Display". Reads the renamed
cvars skate3_match_display and skate3_display_aspect.

